'''Marlon Jones''' (born July 1, 1964) is a former [[NFL]] [[defensive tackle]] who played for the [[Cleveland Browns]] from 1987 to 1989.<ref>{{cite web |title=Marlon Jones - Pro Football Archives |url=https://www.profootballarchives.com/playerj/jone16600.html |website=www.profootballarchives.com |accessdate=22 June 2020 |quote=High School: Milford Mill Academy (Milford Mill, MD)}}</ref> He went to [[Milford Mill Academy]].
